<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">广告与开屏配置</view><view class="notice warn section">当前配置与频次保存在本机；开屏素材和腾讯广告通过微信接口加载。跨设备发布配置、统一按用户限次需接入服务端。管理员权限由服务层校验。</view><view class="card section"><view class="title">小程序全屏开屏展示</view><view class="row config-row"><text>开启开屏展示</text><switch checked="{{startup.enabled}}" bindchange="startupToggle"/></view><view class="startup-type-row"><button wx:for="{{startupTypes}}" wx:key="key" class="startup-type {{startup.type===item.key?'selected':''}}" data-type="{{item.key}}" bindtap="startupType">{{item.label}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{startup.type!=='tencent'}}" class="config-row">{{startup.type==='video'?'视频':'图片'}} HTTPS 素材链接<input value="{{startup.mediaUrl}}" data-key="mediaUrl" bindinput="startupInput" placeholder="https://…"/><text class="caption">素材域名需要在微信公众平台配置；视频默认静音自动播放。</text></view><view wx:else class="config-row">微信流量主插屏广告位 ID<input value="{{startup.unitId}}" data-key="unitId" bindinput="startupInput" placeholder="adunit-…"/><text class="caption">腾讯广告通过微信原生广告接口展示，请填广告位ID，不填普通网页链接；广告样式、关闭方式及填充由微信控制。</text></view><view class="config-row">每位用户每日最多展示次数<input type="number" value="{{startup.dailyLimit}}" data-key="dailyLimit" bindinput="startupInput"/><text class="caption">北京时间每日重置，0表示不展示。游客按当前设备缓存计次，免广告会员不展示。</text></view><block wx:if="{{startup.type!=='tencent'}}"><view class="config-row">展示时长（3—60秒）<input type="number" value="{{startup.duration}}" data-key="duration" bindinput="startupInput"/></view><view class="config-row">几秒后允许跳过（0表示立即可跳过）<input type="number" value="{{startup.skipAfter}}" data-key="skipAfter" bindinput="startupInput"/></view></block><view class="caption mt">每次从外部进入或重新回到小程序时检查频次，站内切换页面不重复展示；关闭后返回原进入页面。素材或广告加载失败自动放行，失败不计展示次数。</view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="saveStartup" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存开屏设置</button></view><view class="card section"><view class="row config-row"><text>开启模拟入口</text><switch checked="{{config.enabled}}" data-key="enabled" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="config-row">激励视频广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.rewardedVideo}}" data-key="rewardedVideo"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">首页Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.homeBanner}}" data-key="homeBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">识餐Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.photoBanner}}" data-key="photoBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">健康记录Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.healthBanner}}" data-key="healthBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">我的Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.profileBanner}}" data-key="profileBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">首页插屏广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.homeInterstitial}}" data-key="homeInterstitial"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">每日完整观看可领取次数<input type="number" value="{{config.dailyLimit}}" data-key="dailyLimit" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">每次赠送识餐 / AI次数<input type="number" value="{{config.grant}}" data-key="grant" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存生效</button></view><view class="card section"><view class="title"><image class="section-symbol" src="/images/ui/edit.svg"/>完整观看奖励记录</view><view wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="id" class="config-row">{{item.date}} · +{{item.grant}}次</view></view></view>